# PROTTOY field path — no scores

When `EXPO_PUBLIC_PROTTOY_BANK=true` (or Prottoy session flow):

- Do **not** import `data/scoring`, `computeScore`, or anything under `supabase/functions/_shared/prottoy-engine/`.
- Do **not** display PS, WI, SRI, VI, bands, flags, reason codes, or “correct” answers on field screens.
- After assessment: completion / sync / hand-back only (`app/completion.js`).
- `finalize-assessment` client helpers must treat the response as ACK-only; ignore any unexpected score keys.
- Marks and keys never ship in Expo bundles or client env vars.
